* CLOCK: 1s period, rising edges at 0.5, 1.5, 2.5, ...
v1 clk gnd pulse(0 5 0 1n 1n 0.5 1)

* RESET: active-low, released once
v2 rst gnd pwl(0 0 0.3 0 0.3001 5 11 5)

* PARALLEL INPUT = 10110011
v3 parallel_in7 gnd dc 5
v4 parallel_in6 gnd dc 0
v5 parallel_in5 gnd dc 5
v6 parallel_in4 gnd dc 5
v7 parallel_in3 gnd dc 0
v8 parallel_in2 gnd dc 0
v9 parallel_in1 gnd dc 5
v10 parallel_in0 gnd dc 5

* SHIFT INPUTS
v11 left_bit  gnd dc 0
v12 right_bit gnd dc 5

* MODE sequence
* 0.0 to 1.3   -> 00 HOLD
* 1.3 to 2.3   -> 11 PARALLEL LOAD
* 2.3 to 3.3   -> 00 HOLD
* 3.3 to 6.3   -> 01 SHIFT LEFT
* 6.3 to 7.3   -> 00 HOLD
* 7.3 to 10.3  -> 10 SHIFT RIGHT

* mode1
v13 mode1 gnd pwl(0 0 1.3 0 1.3001 5 2.3 5 2.3001 0 7.3 0 7.3001 5 11 5)

* mode0
v14 mode0 gnd pwl(0 0 1.3 0 1.3001 5 2.3 5 2.3001 0 3.3 0 3.3001 5 6.3 5 6.3001 0 11 0)


